{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港鐵表示，油麻地站及土瓜灣站昨晚9時許，分別收到乘客反映，乘坐的荃灣綫及屯馬綫列車有異味，部分人表示輕微不適，港鐵人員隨即上車跟進，未有發現異味，並向相關乘客提供協助，其後繼續行程。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港鐵表示，為審慎起見，車務控制中心已安排相關列車，返回車廠檢查。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港鐵已就事件報警。警方列作「雜項」處理。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:42:06.973083+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:24:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T18:38:20.253819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:57.853090+00:00","content_hash":"f7848ee3ad1b5ddab6d9d60cd6c3f48616e703b9ea35dd8e18d39689bd104b31","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}